---
/**
 * REWRITTEN TO SS_WRITING_FOR_KASPAR.md, 26 Nov 2026 (a founder: rewrite the
 * remaining area pages to what Kaspar comments on; ops rulings D3 and D7).
 * Every line of body copy is new: a two-sentence opening; three room sections
 * (stucco house bedrooms, living room shelving, mansion flat bedrooms), each
 * one house-type line in our voice and then what we do; the listed and access
 * sections on the guide's templates, with managed blocks (lifts, managing
