 *   - Little Venice; stucco villas and terraces around Warwick Avenue: facts
 *     file section 1 (S1 "white stucco"; S3 stuccoed villas on the southern
 *     avenues; S1 stuccoed houses, villas and flats around Warwick Avenue and
 *     Clifton Gardens).
 *   - Tall stucco houses on Warrington Crescent and Formosa Street: facts file
 *     section 1 (S2 "imposing stucco crescents"; S4 three storeys, stucco).
 *   - Mansion flats around Elgin Avenue: facts file section 1 (S1, S3).
